      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-20T14:33:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On page 8 in the rule book there is an example of line of sight. It says there that Bunker does not have line of sight on the assault drone because there is a level 2 hex between them. However, bunker is on a level 3 hex and the assault drone is on a level 1. So, does that mean the level 2 blocks line of sight when it's a straight decent like that?</p>",
