      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>On page 8 in the rule book there is an example of line of sight. It says there that Bunker does not have line of sight on the assault drone because there is a level 2 hex between them. However, bunker is on a level 3 hex and the assault drone is on a level 1. So, does that mean the level 2 blocks line of sight when it&#39;s a straight decent like that?</p>",
      "actions_summary": [],
