    {
      "id": 119621,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-20T14:48:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is due to having two hexes of elevation 2 between him and the drone. &nbsp;Bunker can't draw a line to the drone without going through two hexes of elevation two. &nbsp; If the drone was also on elevation 2 or the hexes in a line from Bunker to the drone were elevation 1 he would have LoS. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:52:52.982Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
