      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It is due to having two hexes of elevation 2 between him and the drone. &nbsp;Bunker can&#39;t draw a line to the drone without going through two hexes of elevation two. &nbsp; If the drone was also on elevation 2 or the hexes in a line from Bunker to the drone were elevation 1 he would have LoS. &nbsp;</p>",
      "actions_summary": [],
      "moderator": false,
      "admin": false,
      "staff": false,
      "user_id": 5464,
      "hidden": false,
      "trust_level": 2,
      "deleted_at": null,
      "user_deleted": false,
